<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Altars</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Charli xcx</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Wuthering Heights</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">37Vbx4pkj4QdmE4fPfAdoD</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.022" end="00:16.022">As I kneel before your altar, I begin to cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.426" end="00:31.349">You were my perfect blue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.349" end="00:36.573">My hands together in a search for proof</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.573" end="00:42.705">Silence rang out from your window</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.705" end="00:44.421" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.421" end="00:49.124">One is not the loneliest number</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.124" end="00:53.496">I won't keep putting all my faith in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.496" end="00:58.023">One is not the loneliest number</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.023" end="01:01.282">Got me turning far away from you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.282" end="01:02.782" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.468" end="01:04.921">I'm at your altar, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.921" end="01:10.345">I once believed, I once believed I was free</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.345" end="01:18.000">I'm at your altar, baby, now I can see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.000" end="01:21.946">You're gonna end up killing me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.946" end="01:26.164">Oh, I must only be one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.164" end="01:28.090" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.090" end="01:36.090">As I lie awake in this room, I bеgin to pray</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.394" end="01:54.394">You and I so violently could be togethеr in forbidden scene</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.374" end="02:02.681">My mind is torturing the body</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.681" end="02:04.455" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.455" end="02:09.070">One is not the loneliest number</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.070" end="02:13.524">I won't keep putting all my faith in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.524" end="02:18.149">One is not the loneliest number</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.149" end="02:21.306">Got me turning far away from you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.306" end="02:22.806" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.448" end="02:24.917">I'm at your altar, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.917" end="02:30.272">I once believed, I once believed I was free</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.272" end="02:38.034">I'm at your altar, baby, now I can see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.034" end="02:41.783">You're gonna end up killing me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.783" end="02:47.488">Oh, I must only be one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.488" end="02:51.919">I must only be one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.919" end="02:55.919">I must only be one</p></div></body></tt>